{"id":"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-term.md","title":"Term","display":"df-term — Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-term","aliases":["56-df-term"],"display":"df-term — Term","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-first-order-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23afff2411185eaa\" href=\"?note=23afff2411185eaa\" title=\"56-df-first-order-language\">56-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\operatorname{ar}_P)\">\\(L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\operatorname{ar}_P)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23afff2411185eaa\" href=\"?note=23afff2411185eaa\" title=\"56-df-first-order-language\">56-df-first-order-language</a> 的一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L)\">\\(\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L)\\)</span> 为其函数符号签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为可数无限变量集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\cap(F_L\\cup P_L)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal V\\cap(F_L\\cup P_L)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为任意形式表达式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a> 的自由有限项集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Term}_L\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}_L(t)\\iff t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Term}_L(t)\\iff t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此原子将旧一阶逻辑项记号接到本书项集，避免维护两套互不对应的项语法。谓词符号不参与项构造。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，定义2.1.2，印刷第26页，OCR页块47；一阶语言接口为本笔记的显式参数化。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"23afff2411185eaa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"23afff2411185eaa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\operatorname{ar}_P)$ 为 [[56-df-first-order-language]] 的一阶语言，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L)$ 为其函数符号签名。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)$ 取 [[56-df-terms]] 的自由有限项集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\operatorname{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\operatorname{ar}_L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\cap(F_L\\cup P_L)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_L\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}_L(t)\\iff t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L.","display":true}],"bytes":1162,"backlinks":[{"id":"06f27abe4d7ff714","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$ 为 [[56-df-first-order-language]] 的语言，$T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)$ 见 [[56-df-term]]。"},{"id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$；项集 $\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 与公式集 $\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 分别见 [[56-df-term]]、[[56-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-367","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-term]]"}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc","23afff2411185eaa"]}